{
    "title": "Car Games: Monster Truck Stunt",
    "description": "Get ready for a truck driver in Car Games. Fine-tune your Monster Truck, keep your foot on the gas, make your high-speed jump and become an Impossible Car Games: Monster Truck\r\n\r\nWith your favorite character, you choose a car and show your class skills in this Car Game: Monster Truck Stunt. The more levels you win, the more points you'll earn to own personalized car\r\n\r\nCar Games: Monster Truck Stunt CUSTOMIZATION\r\n\u2022 Adjustable colors with detailed 3D car game models\r\n\u2022 Engine tuning: swap engine, turbo, gearbox, and exhaust.\r\n\u2022 Visual auto tungs: Car stunt body parts.\r\n\u2022 Big & small Monster truck car game skins\r\n\u2022 Customize your Crazy Car\r\n\r\nCharacter Selection\r\n\u2022 More than 50 Popular including superpower in car games\r\n\u2022 Select both Team Super Power vs bad guy\r\n\u2022 Customize color for your Truck in car games\r\n\u2022 Select the superpower and car stunt with the iron robot or other in car game\r\n\r\nCar Games: Monster Truck Stunt SELECTION\r\n\u2022 Select Monster Truck vs other smallest & biggest Beam Drive car game in the world\r\n\u2022 Select GT truck vs master car stunt\r\n\r\nVarious maps from Car Games\r\n\u2022 Jump Challenge in the crazy map from Car games with Superpower\r\n\u2022 Drive a Monster Truck to jump and parkour in Car stunt\r\n\u2022 Enjoy funny moments with the new ultra ramp, double mega ramp, a vertical ramp, longest mega ramp, and other challenge stunt maps\r\n\u2022 Explore epic arenas like Monster Big Jam in car games\r\n\r\nJust into the car game, conquer the Crazy Mega Ramp and discover scenarios and landscapes\r\nGet ready and drift on the Car Games: Monster Truck Stunt\r\n\r\nReady to release stress and become a master driver in a Car game? Tap and enjoy!",
